add(b,'oral','An original story becomes a child’s book','Child ideas; paper; writing/drawing tools; optional scribe/AAC','Communicate an authored story through an accessible form.','Invite a child-chosen event or imagined story.~Support a beginning/change/ending without taking over.~Record, reread and revise to match the child’s intended meaning.','Oral tradition and purposeful literacy can support one another.','Authorship, sequence, language and support.','Offer a real willing audience.','Protect privacy and cultural ownership; do not force disclosure or interpret a story as a diagnosis.','Storytelling and writing')
add(b,'oral','Read a meaningful play message','Checked text with taught sound-spelling patterns; adult support','Use suitable explicit reading support in a real context.','Confirm the text is accessible through known/taught patterns.~Model or support decoding rather than picture guessing.~Read the message and discuss what it means for the play.','Coordinate with the child’s school and individual plan; do not delay needed instruction until age seven or tooth changes.','Decoding, meaning and adult support separately.','Revisit a suitable pattern in another meaningful text.','Respect language and disability access. No timed ranking or exclusion from support based on philosophy.','Purposeful literacy')
add(b,'play','Build a shared imaginative project','Safe construction and pretend materials; work-in-progress area','Develop a collaborative idea with real child agency.','Hear each willing participant’s idea.~Support accessible roles and safe construction.~Revisit and revise based on the children’s purposes.','Let children change direction; protect consent and boundaries.','Planning, social support and revision.','Document the child’s explanation if desired.','Avoid unstable overhead structures, entrapment and exclusion; adults stop harm.','Imaginative project play')
add(b,'arts','Create and revise an expressive work','Safe chosen art media; storage for work in progress','Sustain an original expression across time.','Invite a child-chosen purpose.~Offer safe technique support without supplying a required model.~Let the child decide what to revise and whether to share.','No art product proves readiness, temperament or intelligence.','Intent, material choices and change over time.','Explore another medium if wanted.','Use non-toxic accessible materials; no heated wax, solvents, dusty pigments or unsafe tools.','Arts')
add(b,'arts','Simple paper weaving or short-strand braiding','Wide paper strips or short reviewed strands; safe support surface','Explore a repeated handwork relationship and chosen pattern.','Show one over/under or crossing action.~Support a short chosen sequence.~Check the pattern and restore all materials.','Handwork is an invitation, not a readiness test for school.','Sequence, coordination, preference and help seeking.','Use the result in a child-chosen project.','Direct adult supervision of strands; no wearable loops, neck ties or long cords. No sharp needles; choose paper/adapted tools when safer.','Handwork')
add(b,'nature','A real place to care for and describe','Safe local outdoor space; appropriate child-safe care tools; reliable reference','Connect observation, practical care and community responsibility.','Observe a real need and hear children’s ideas.~Verify a safe useful response with adult guidance.~Carry it out and record what actually changed.','Respect living things and distinguish evidence from story imagination.','Observation, purpose and whether the care helped.','Share a factual finding through drawing, writing or another accessible form.','No pesticides, sharp pruning, unknown fungi/plants, animal waste or wildlife disturbance. Follow local outdoor and hygiene procedures.','Nature and community')
assert len(activities)==70
assert all(sum(x['ageBand']==b[0] for x in activities)==10 for b in bands)
assert all(any(x['ageBand']==b[0] and x['area']==a[0] for x in activities) for b in bands for a in areas)
pack={'title':'Waldorf-inspired Early Childhood Curriculum','edition':'1.0 original secular and inclusive adaptation','ageScope':'Birth through age six; final pathway includes 5- and 6-year-olds through 83 months.','approach':'Warm relationships, responsive rhythm, imitation, purposeful work, imaginative play, oral storytelling, arts/handwork and nature.','officiallyEndorsed':False,'areas':[dict(id=i,title=t,purpose=p) for i,t,p in areas],'ageBands':[dict(id=i,title=t,label=label,minMonths=lo,maxMonthsExclusive=hi) for i,t,label,lo,hi in bands],'activities':activities}
(R/'curriculum.json').write_text(json.dumps(pack,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
with (R/'Waldorf_Activity_Library_70.csv').open('w',newline='') as f:
 w=csv.writer(f,lineterminator='\n');w.writerow(['Activity ID','Age pathway','Learning strand','Title','Purpose','Materials','Sequence','Adult role','Observe','Possible next opportunity','Access','Safety','Family connection'])
 bn={b[0]:b[1]+' · '+b[2] for b in bands};an={a[0]:a[1] for a in areas}
 for x in activities:w.writerow([x['id'],bn[x['ageBand']],an[x['area']],x['title'],x['purpose'],x['materials'],' / '.join(x['steps']),x['adultRole'],x['observe'],x['nextOpportunity'],x['inclusion'],x['safety'],x['familyConnection']])
print('Authored 70 Waldorf-inspired activity plans across seven pathways and seven strands.')
